        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Moscow Hemp Fest\n- Organizations: University of Idaho\n- Places: Moscow, Idaho; Latah County; Idaho; United States\n- Topics: cannabis events; Mom's Weekend\n\nFacts:\n- The University of Idaho is the oldest public university in the U.S. state of Idaho.\n- The University of Idaho is located in Moscow in Latah County in northern Idaho.\n- The University of Idaho is officially abbreviated UI and is locally referred to as the U of I.\n- Moscow Hemp Fest is an annual cannabis event held in Moscow, Idaho, in the United States.\n- Moscow Hemp Fest is sometimes called Moscow Hempfest.\n- Moscow Hemp Fest began in 1996 for the University of Idaho's Mom's Weekend.",
